      than sequential — explains DataLoader shuffle overhead
    • PCIe effective bandwidth: 12–20 GB/s (not the 32 GB/s spec)
    • Pinned memory cuts CPU→GPU transfer time by ~2×
    • Use pin_memory=True + non_blocking=True in every DataLoader
